+## Checking against your budget
+
+The `budget` command shows how much you spent in each category for a month
+alongside the limit you have configured for that category:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+Categories where spending has exceeded the configured budget are flagged so they
+stand out. Budget limits are set in the `budgets` section of your configuration
+file.
+
